{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act41side_level_act41side_07_beg","storyGroup":"act41side","storySort":15,"storyDependence":"act41side_level_act41side_st02","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"EA-7","storyName":"烧灯者","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"爱布拉娜倒下，城中的紫火却越烧越烈，拉芙希妮、涅梅丝、布莉吉，三个人各自行动起来......第二个故事到此结束。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act41side/level_act41side_07_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act41side_07","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":13,"next":15,"characters":["“领袖”","阿赫茉妮","涅梅丝","高尚的红龙","神秘的女性","作家"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a7/Avg_bg_bg_wilderness_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":11},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"小丘郡还有多远？","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#7","focus":"m","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"远着呢。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#1","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"姐姐她......不会不知道的。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#7","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"说实话，只有“雄辩家”那帮人以为事情天衣无缝。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#6","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"那你还跟着我？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-6.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"如果有得选，我也想美美在之前的营地里睡一觉啊。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"姐姐为什么不阻止我？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#1","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"不知道。说不定对你寄予厚望吧。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#2","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"不，她从来没对我露出过那样的眼神。在我同意做她的影子之后，她......","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"阿赫茉妮，我请求你......我请求你去告诉姐姐，我不想这样。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#7","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"不想去小丘郡？","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-7.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#2","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"嗯。还有，如果姐姐心情还不错的话，我还想请你告诉她，从今以后，我——","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"......","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"不，没有了。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿赫茉妮","text":"好吧，我就勉为其难替你传这个话。“雄辩家”的眼线还挺难躲的呢。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_npc_228_1-1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"嗯，谢谢，请你快些去吧......","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_228_1#1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":44},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_226_weed_1#2","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“领袖”","text":"......在姐姐......彻底厌倦之前。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c8/Avg_avg_226_weed_1-2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","id":53},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":57},{"type":"subtitle","text":"直到她到了小丘郡，阿赫茉妮才姗姗来迟。她明白这意味着什么。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":58},{"type":"subtitle","text":"然后，在那个夜晚，炮声轰鸣，晶簇生长，她倒在小丘郡的街道上，血从她的腹部流出来。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":59},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她没有觉得多害怕，她反倒觉得如释重负。她可以像无数普通人一样死去。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":60},{"type":"subtitle","text":"然后她看见，不远处的高楼上，那紫色的火焰来了。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":61},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她这时才感到害怕。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":62},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她怕那火没有看见自己，将自己和街道上的人一同变成傀儡。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":63},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她怕那火看见了自己，将受伤的自己带回，让自己继续当她的影子。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":64},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她和那火对视，试图从中得到什么关于自己未来的暗示，但她能看见的只有厌烦。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":65},{"type":"subtitle","text":"她最害怕的事终于发生了。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":66},{"type":"subtitle","id":67},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":68},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":69},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":70},{"type":"charslot","id":71},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/39/Avg_bg_59_g12_castlecorridor_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":72},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":75},{"type":"text","text":"死去的红龙躺在地上。","id":76},{"type":"text","text":"活着的红龙身后，离群的守灵人刚刚明白一切。","id":77},{"type":"dialog","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_bg_59_g15_castlebalcony_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":83},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act22side/m_avg_act22side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":84,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"......她骗了您。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"不，她没有欺骗任何人。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"她算准了您不愿让整座城市的人为她陪葬，所以才自导自演了这么一出戏！","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"她引诱您刺穿她的躯壳，而她自己则得以摆脱束缚，让本来还没那么凶猛的紫火能在夏末节前夜把所有人烧光！","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"她为什么要为了一个平时从来不放在眼里的节日......冒这样的风险？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"红龙，我也是身染紫火的活人，就连我也感受得到，死火正在我胸口燃烧，比任何时候都冰冷，冷得我马上就要失去知觉！","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"不管她现在是在图谋整个塔拉，还是她已经疯了，只想拉着一城的人跟她一起死，怎样都好，这些根本就不重要！","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"不，塔拉已经是她的囊中之物，她也绝对没有疯，那她......","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"她——","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"......","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"涅梅丝，她的尸首还在吗？","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我去看看。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":111},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":112},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.6","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.5","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"200,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"2","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":119},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":120},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":121},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.6","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.5","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"300,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"2","id":124},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":125},{"type":"text","text":"离群守灵人的眉毛拧成一团。也许她这辈子还没生出过这么大的恶意，自然也就没下过这么大的决心。","id":126},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"她的尸首就在——","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":130},{"type":"charslot","id":131},{"type":"text","text":"她的回答声被熊熊的燃烧声盖了过去。","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"不管她究竟要做什么，纳斯尔纱还没有燃尽，还火仪式仍然办得下去......必须要办下去。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我明白您的意思了。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我去告诉城里人这个消息。告诉他们，那条被他们奉若神明的邪恶的红龙已经死去。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"布莉吉呢？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"我已经拜托她离开城市，去找守灵人了。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"但你该怎么告诉其他人爱布拉娜已经死了？","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"拖棺。那条红龙应得的。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"虽然城里连棺材都快不够了，但她毕竟不是什么死在街头的无名小卒，她配得上一副。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"......","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"您不愿意？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/33/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#13$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"不，我只是第一次意识到，爱布拉娜究竟走在一条多么丑陋的道路上。现在这条路正向我招手，而我......别无选择。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-13$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"去吧，涅梅丝，我会为你争取时间。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1692_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"涅梅丝","text":"争取时间，您是说黑雾？","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1692_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"没错。如果黑雾看准了夏末节，非要进城来凑热闹，我会拖住它。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1020_reed2_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"高尚的红龙","text":"我已经等不及要向黑雾请教，该如何让红龙的火光归于黑暗了。","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1a/Avg_avg_1020_reed2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":162},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":163},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"charslot","id":166},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_bg_snowconutryinside.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":168},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":169,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":172},{"type":"charslot","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"“我已经等不及要向黑雾请教，该如何让红龙的火光归于黑暗了。”","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"怎么样？","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"按照这样的发展，镜中人和红龙的结局已经呼之欲出了。","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"charslot","id":179},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":180},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairbump","channel":"1","id":181},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","channel":"2","id":182},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":183},{"type":"text","text":"可作家腾的一声站起身来。","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"你到底是谁，你到底要做什么？","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"补全您不愿意讲完的故事啊。","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"您不是觉得我是那种喜欢“拼凑真相”的家伙吗？我们离真相已经很近很近了。","id":189},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"够了，我得走了——","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"如果您无论如何都不愿意由自己来讲出那个结局，那就还是由我来把故事补完，怎么样？","id":193},{"type":"dialog","id":194},{"type":"charslot","id":195},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":196},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":197},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>忽然，不知是谁睁开双眼，镜中人吓得松开了手，而忘乎所以的红龙掉进了篝火中，火焰熊熊燃烧，镜中人趁机躲回了镜子里。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":198},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>可等到火势渐小之后，红龙的身影再没有出现，人们为找不到红龙焦急不已。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":199},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>镜中人想去跟大家解释原委，找到让红龙回来的方法，但没有了红龙，她已经无法从镜子里面出来了。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":200},{"type":"subtitle","id":201},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":202},{"type":"charslot","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"如何？","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","id":206},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"......","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"我看到您一直在瞥那边的报刊栏了。报纸可不一定只报道事实，先生。","id":210},{"type":"text","text":"作家瞟了一眼酒馆门口。","id":211},{"type":"text","text":"他想象了一下自己拔腿跑出酒馆的场景。很滑稽，滑稽到他自己差点笑出来。","id":212},{"type":"text","text":"如果报纸没有“报道事实”，那他终于知道这个人是谁了。至于她为什么来找自己，理由也很好猜。","id":213},{"type":"text","text":"总之，自己是无论如何都跑不掉的。","id":214},{"type":"text","text":"但他同时也意识到一件事。","id":215},{"type":"text","text":"也许，他真的可以找到某个如他所愿的结局。","id":216},{"type":"text","text":"不管她到底是谁，只要还在聊故事，他们就是平等的。","id":217},{"type":"text","text":"他觉得刚才那股颓丧劲儿正在消退。","id":218},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"小姐，我现在不管你是谁，也不管你到底要来做什么，但故事就不该这么写。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"你只是给一个没结尾的故事延续了一截，结局仍然付之阙如。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"我问你，你看见了......一条红龙杀死另一条的场景？","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"就和您看见英雄将红龙的骨架拖上广场一样，“创作”，仅此而已。","id":225},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"那就对你的创作负责。镜子里的红龙失手让另一个自己在篝火中烧死，然后呢？人们做了什么？躲回镜子里的红龙呢？","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"您呢？您就没什么想法？","id":229},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"charslot","id":231},{"type":"text","text":"作家久违地从口袋里摸出钢笔，又从桌上抓起一张纸牌。他想写下点什么，但钢笔太久没用，已经干了。","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"我还需要......一点时间。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"但是，连得上，连得上......也许能连得上......","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"连得上？","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"我猜，您想说的，是您出版的最后一个故事？","id":239},{"type":"dialog","id":240},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"text","text":"作家的钢笔在纸牌上狠狠划过，终于有一丝墨水渗了出来。","id":242},{"type":"text","text":"“愿死亡将我们与一切传奇相连”，这句西莫·威廉姆斯的话突然闯进了他的脑海。","id":243},{"type":"text","text":"西莫·威廉姆斯已经死了，而自己也许......真的能不揣冒昧地......与他书写的传奇相连。","id":244},{"type":"text","text":"他想把这句诗在纸牌上扒拉出来，但钢笔尖只在纸上留下了几道断裂到无法辨认的墨迹。","id":245},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"也许......","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"怎么？","id":249},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairrub","channel":"1","id":252},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":253},{"type":"text","text":"作家坐回了椅子上，甚至比刚才坐得更直了一些。","id":254},{"type":"text","text":"他突然感受到某种冲动，和他第一次听见西莫·威廉姆斯的诗时类似的冲动。","id":255},{"type":"text","text":"那让他一路沦落至此，但他至今仍记得的，那种紧紧捏住他的胸腹，让他迫不及待想歌唱、想呐喊——","id":256},{"type":"text","text":"想创作的冲动。","id":257},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"也许你的确替我解决了一些问题。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"我说过，我看见的、我相信的、我说出口的，彼此全都背道而驰。但拜你所赐，它们似乎终于有了一点融为一体的迹象。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"那真是再好不过了。","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"那么，您可以开始讲述第三个故事了吗？","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"当然......当然。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"不仅如此，我还需要你的协助，小姐。","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"在我卡壳的时候，我需要你来讲。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1698_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"这是我的故事，但也是你的。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"作家","text":"从一开始就是你的。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1698_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"神秘的女性","text":"乐意效劳。","id":272},{"type":"dialog","id":273},{"type":"charslot","id":274},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","channel":"1","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":276},{"type":"text","text":"作家的呼吸急促，脸上泛起激动的潮红。钢笔无论怎么划也没法正常写字，他干脆把那玩意儿往桌子上一摔。","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"是了，是了。","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"那些事情，他见得还不够多吗？","id":279},{"type":"text","text":"又能怎么样呢？","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"他是个作家，他马上就要为自己的故事找到结局。","id":281},{"type":"dialog","id":282},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":285},{"type":"charslot","id":286},{"type":"background","id":287},{"type":"image","id":288}],"characters":["“领袖”","阿赫茉妮","涅梅丝","高尚的红龙","神秘的女性","作家"]}